  Nowadays, using AI tools to finish school tasks has become a common phenomenon. Opinions vary from person to person. As far as I am concerned, AI is a useful tool for 
self-improvement, but we must use it within proper limits.
  For one thing, AI can bring great convenience to our study. It offers useful information and guidance when we meet difficult problems. For another, over-reliance on AI may 
cause problems. Some students use AI to complete homework without independent thinking, which weakens their ability to think on their own.
  From my perspective, we should use AI tools with independent thinking. Only in this way can we benefit from AI and make steady progress in our study.
